---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Relaflow | The systems behind lasting relationships"
  description="Relaflow provides the media, advisory, and training organizations need to effectively navigate and strengthen their vital relationships."
>
  <!-- About Us -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 pt-20 pb-20 md:px-10 md:pt-28 md:pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      

      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl leading-[1.1] sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
        About Us
      </h1>

      <div class="mt-7 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
        <p>
          Relaflow provides the media, advisory, and training organizations need to effectively navigate and strengthen their vital relationships.
        </p>

        <p>
          We believe relationships hold up best when they are supported by clear systems, good information, and consistent follow-through.
        </p>

        <p>
          Everything we do, from sharing insights to hands-on advisory work, is built around that belief, helping organizations bring more structure and consistency to the relationships that matter most to them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Approach -->
  <section class="border-t border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-24">

      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">
        Our Approach
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">

        <div class="rounded border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl">
            We build systems organizations can run themselves.
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65">
            We help organizations develop the processes and skills to manage their own relationships well.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl">
            We build for repeatability.
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65">
            We help organizations create systems, manual or automated, that keep relationship history and progress intact, even as staff or roles change.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl">
            We keep it simple.
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65">
            We use plain language and practical tools that are easy to apply.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl">
            We treat this as ongoing work.
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65">
            We help organizations keep refining how they manage relationships over time.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>